        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se muestra el estado actual del reporte. Una acción de resolución coincidente identifica tu conciliación original; no se envió una acción nueva."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The current report status will be checked first. Retiring this local attempt does not undo a received decision or prove which action resolved the report.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The current report status will be checked first. Retiring this local attempt does not undo a received decision or prove which action resolved the report."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Primero se verificará el estado actual del reporte. Retirar este intento local no deshace una decisión recibida ni demuestra qué acción resolvió el reporte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The local reconciliation retry was retired after checking current status. Its original evidence remains saved. This does not undo a shared action; refresh and review before starting another.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The local reconciliation retry was retired after checking current status. Its original evidence remains saved. This does not undo a shared action; refresh and review before starting another."
          }
